keywords Deathcharger's Reins, Rivendare's Deathcharger, Baron Rivendare, Stratholme, dungeon, skeletal horse
collects 13335
levels 58-60
zone Eastern Plaguelands

# Deathcharger's Reins: a rare drop from Baron Rivendare at the end of
# Stratholme's undead side.
# Stratholme (58-60) is in Forever.
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level 60, Journeyman
# Riding); items.json (drop chance, pfQuest) and objects.json (the Service
# Entrance at Elders' Square).
# The Service Entrance is at 41.5,17.7 on Forever's Eastern Plaguelands map:
# objects.json places it at 47.9,23.8 on the Era map, which Forever redrew
# (converted with both maps' frames in map-frames.json, as
# data/codex/entrances.json notes). This guide used the Era position as
# a live one until 0.2.4.

step Journeyman Riding
  tip Deathcharger's Reins needs level 60 and Journeyman Riding to ride (Forever client). Train it at your race's riding trainer; see the Level 60 mount guides.
  level 60
  skill Riding 150

step Stratholme: Baron Rivendare
  tip Stratholme is a group of five, level 58-60. The Service Entrance at Elders' Square, in north-western Eastern Plaguelands, leads to the undead side; Baron Rivendare waits in the Slaughter House at its end. Our data gives the reins a 0.02% drop chance (pfQuest, Era): one in about five thousand kills. Nothing shows Forever changing it.
  goto 41.5,17.7 "Stratholme Service Entrance"
  collect 13335 @41.5,17.7            -- Baron Rivendare
